Name, description, invalid and required state, error announcement, Enter submission, autocomplete passthrough, contrast (border 3:1 and focus ring in light and dark), forced colors and target size all verified in Chromium; axe, the 12 Input behavior tests and `npm run check` pass. No open findings.
